      {"bad":"The school opened a new sports section. They built a three-courts hall beside the field. Students could play indoors in winter. The hall also hosted a six-teams tournament. The first match drew a large crowd.","good":"The school opened a new sports section. They built a three-court hall beside the field. Students could play indoors in winter. The hall also hosted a six-team tournament. The first match drew a large crowd.","explanation":"Keep the modifier singular: \"three-court\", \"six-team\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The school opened a new sports section.","good":"The school opened a new sports section."},{"bad":"They built a three-courts hall beside the field.","good":"They built a three-court hall beside the field."},{"bad":"Students could play indoors in winter.","good":"Students could play indoors in winter."},{"bad":"The hall also hosted a six-teams tournament.","good":"The hall also hosted a six-team tournament."},{"bad":"The first match drew a large crowd.","good":"The first match drew a large crowd."}]},
      {"bad":"The company offered a special travel deal. It included a seven-days cruise for two. The cabin looked out over the sea. Guests received a four-courses dinner each evening. The trip sold out quickly.","good":"The company offered a special travel deal. It included a seven-day cruise for two. The cabin looked out over the sea. Guests received a four-course dinner each evening. The trip sold out quickly.","explanation":"Modifiers stay singular: \"seven-day cruise\", \"four-course dinner\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The company offered a special travel deal.","good":"The company offered a special travel deal."},{"bad":"It included a seven-days cruise for two.","good":"It included a seven-day cruise for two."},{"bad":"The cabin looked out over the sea.","good":"The cabin looked out over the sea."},{"bad":"Guests received a four-courses dinner each evening.","good":"Guests received a four-course dinner each evening."},{"bad":"The trip sold out quickly.","good":"The trip sold out quickly."}]},
