    "6.8": [
      {"bad":"The team met to plan the new project. They discussed about the schedule for an hour. Everyone wrote down the key dates. The manager then explained about the budget. The meeting ended on time.","good":"The team met to plan the new project. They discussed the schedule for an hour. Everyone wrote down the key dates. The manager then explained the budget. The meeting ended on time.","explanation":"\"Discuss\" and \"explain\" take a direct object, with no \"about\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The team met to plan the new project.","good":"The team met to plan the new project."},{"bad":"They discussed about the schedule for an hour.","good":"They discussed the schedule for an hour."},{"bad":"Everyone wrote down the key dates.","good":"Everyone wrote down the key dates."},{"bad":"The manager then explained about the budget.","good":"The manager then explained the budget."},{"bad":"The meeting ended on time.","good":"The meeting ended on time."}]},
