    "6.10": [
      {"bad":"The children wanted to help in the garden. They tried to goes outside before the rain. The dark clouds gathered quickly. They hoped to finishes before dinner. They managed to tidy the whole shed.","good":"The children wanted to help in the garden. They tried to go outside before the rain. The dark clouds gathered quickly. They hoped to finish before dinner. They managed to tidy the whole shed.","explanation":"After \"to\" use the base form: \"to go\", \"to finish\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The children wanted to help in the garden.","good":"The children wanted to help in the garden."},{"bad":"They tried to goes outside before the rain.","good":"They tried to go outside before the rain."},{"bad":"The dark clouds gathered quickly.","good":"The dark clouds gathered quickly."},{"bad":"They hoped to finishes before dinner.","good":"They hoped to finish before dinner."},{"bad":"They managed to tidy the whole shed.","good":"They managed to tidy the whole shed."}]},
