    "6.12": [
      {"bad":"The pupils prepared for the school trip. Everyone must to bring a packed lunch. The bus leaves at eight sharp. The children can to wear casual clothes. The trip lasts the whole day.","good":"The pupils prepared for the school trip. Everyone must bring a packed lunch. The bus leaves at eight sharp. The children can wear casual clothes. The trip lasts the whole day.","explanation":"Modals take the base form with no \"to\": \"must bring\", \"can wear\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The pupils prepared for the school trip.","good":"The pupils prepared for the school trip."},{"bad":"Everyone must to bring a packed lunch.","good":"Everyone must bring a packed lunch."},{"bad":"The bus leaves at eight sharp.","good":"The bus leaves at eight sharp."},{"bad":"The children can to wear casual clothes.","good":"The children can wear casual clothes."},{"bad":"The trip lasts the whole day.","good":"The trip lasts the whole day."}]},
