    "8.4": [
      {"bad":"I met an old friend last week. She is the person I spoke. We talked for a long time. She mentioned the job she applied. I promised to stay in touch.","good":"I met an old friend last week. She is the person I spoke to. We talked for a long time. She mentioned the job she applied for. I promised to stay in touch.","explanation":"Keep the preposition with its verb: \"spoke to\", \"applied for\".","sentences":[{"bad":"I met an old friend last week.","good":"I met an old friend last week."},{"bad":"She is the person I spoke.","good":"She is the person I spoke to."},{"bad":"We talked for a long time.","good":"We talked for a long time."},{"bad":"She mentioned the job she applied.","good":"She mentioned the job she applied for."},{"bad":"I promised to stay in touch.","good":"I promised to stay in touch."}]},
      {"bad":"The house was built long ago. It is the house I live. The rooms are small but warm. The garden is what I like most about it. I hope to stay for years.","good":"The house was built long ago. It is the house I live in. The rooms are small but warm. The garden is what I like most about it. I hope to stay for years.","explanation":"Use \"the house I live in\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The house was built long ago.","good":"The house was built long ago."},{"bad":"It is the house I live.","good":"It is the house I live in."},{"bad":"The rooms are small but warm.","good":"The rooms are small but warm."},{"bad":"The garden is what I like most about it.","good":"The garden is what I like most about it."},{"bad":"I hope to stay for years.","good":"I hope to stay for years."}]},
      {"bad":"The teacher gave us a task. She is the teacher we were talking. We had to write a short essay. The topic is one we are all interested. We handed the essays in on Friday.","good":"The teacher gave us a task. She is the teacher we were talking about. We had to write a short essay. The topic is one we are all interested in. We handed the essays in on Friday.","explanation":"Keep \"talking about\" and \"interested in\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The teacher gave us a task.","good":"The teacher gave us a task."},{"bad":"She is the teacher we were talking.","good":"She is the teacher we were talking about."},{"bad":"We had to write a short essay.","good":"We had to write a short essay."},{"bad":"The topic is one we are all interested.","good":"The topic is one we are all interested in."},{"bad":"We handed the essays in on Friday.","good":"We handed the essays in on Friday."}]},
      {"bad":"The shop sells old records. It is the shop my father bought his first guitar. He still visits it sometimes. The owner is a man he knows well. They always talk about music.","good":"The shop sells old records. It is the shop my father bought his first guitar from. He still visits it sometimes. The owner is a man he knows well. They always talk about music.","explanation":"Use \"the shop ... bought his first guitar from\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The shop sells old records.","good":"The shop sells old records."},{"bad":"It is the shop my father bought his first guitar.","good":"It is the shop my father bought his first guitar from."},{"bad":"He still visits it sometimes.","good":"He still visits it sometimes."},{"bad":"The owner is a man he knows well.","good":"The owner is a man he knows well."},{"bad":"They always talk about music.","good":"They always talk about music."}]},
      {"bad":"The team needed a new coach. They hired the man everyone had heard. He had a strong record. He was the person they had been looking. The team improved under him.","good":"The team needed a new coach. They hired the man everyone had heard of. He had a strong record. He was the person they had been looking for. The team improved under him.","explanation":"Keep \"heard of\" and \"looking for\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The team needed a new coach.","good":"The team needed a new coach."},{"bad":"They hired the man everyone had heard.","good":"They hired the man everyone had heard of."},{"bad":"He had a strong record.","good":"He had a strong record."},{"bad":"He was the person they had been looking.","good":"He was the person they had been looking for."},{"bad":"The team improved under him.","good":"The team improved under him."}]}
