    "11.5": [
      {"bad":"The committee reviewed the plan. The final outcome was a clear success. The whole team celebrated. They discussed the past history of the project. Everyone felt proud of the work.","good":"The committee reviewed the plan. The outcome was a clear success. The whole team celebrated. They discussed the history of the project. Everyone felt proud of the work.","explanation":"Avoid redundant pairs: \"outcome\" and \"history\" already imply finality and the past.","sentences":[{"bad":"The committee reviewed the plan.","good":"The committee reviewed the plan."},{"bad":"The final outcome was a clear success.","good":"The outcome was a clear success."},{"bad":"The whole team celebrated.","good":"The whole team celebrated."},{"bad":"They discussed the past history of the project.","good":"They discussed the history of the project."},{"bad":"Everyone felt proud of the work.","good":"Everyone felt proud of the work."}]},
      {"bad":"The report summarised the findings. It described the basic fundamentals of the method. The method was clearly explained. The results were a added bonus. The report was well received.","good":"The report summarised the findings. It described the fundamentals of the method. The method was clearly explained. The results were a bonus. The report was well received.","explanation":"\"Fundamentals\" and \"bonus\" do not need \"basic\" or \"added\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The report summarised the findings.","good":"The report summarised the findings."},{"bad":"It described the basic fundamentals of the method.","good":"It described the fundamentals of the method."},{"bad":"The method was clearly explained.","good":"The method was clearly explained."},{"bad":"The results were a added bonus.","good":"The results were a bonus."},{"bad":"The report was well received.","good":"The report was well received."}]},
      {"bad":"The garden was in a poor state. The weeds were tall and overgrown. We decided to tidy it up. We made a plan together to cooperate jointly. The garden looked lovely by autumn.","good":"The garden was in a poor state. The weeds were overgrown. We decided to tidy it up. We made a plan to work together. The garden looked lovely by autumn.","explanation":"Cut redundant words: \"overgrown\" already means tall, and \"together\" covers \"jointly\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The garden was in a poor state.","good":"The garden was in a poor state."},{"bad":"The weeds were tall and overgrown.","good":"The weeds were overgrown."},{"bad":"We decided to tidy it up.","good":"We decided to tidy it up."},{"bad":"We made a plan together to cooperate jointly.","good":"We made a plan to work together."},{"bad":"The garden looked lovely by autumn.","good":"The garden looked lovely by autumn."}]},
      {"bad":"The meeting was short. We returned back to the office afterwards. The afternoon was productive. We each wrote our own personal notes. The project moved forward.","good":"The meeting was short. We returned to the office afterwards. The afternoon was productive. We each wrote our personal notes. The project moved forward.","explanation":"\"Returned\" needs no \"back\"; \"own\" and \"personal\" are redundant.","sentences":[{"bad":"The meeting was short.","good":"The meeting was short."},{"bad":"We returned back to the office afterwards.","good":"We returned to the office afterwards."},{"bad":"The afternoon was productive.","good":"The afternoon was productive."},{"bad":"We each wrote our own personal notes.","good":"We each wrote our personal notes."},{"bad":"The project moved forward.","good":"The project moved forward."}]},
      {"bad":"The travellers packed light. They met together at the entrance. The bus was already waiting. They shared the same identical map. The trip began on time.","good":"The travellers packed light. They met at the entrance. The bus was already waiting. They shared an identical map. The trip began on time.","explanation":"Remove redundant words: \"met\" implies together; \"same\" and \"identical\" overlap.","sentences":[{"bad":"The travellers packed light.","good":"The travellers packed light."},{"bad":"They met together at the entrance.","good":"They met at the entrance."},{"bad":"The bus was already waiting.","good":"The bus was already waiting."},{"bad":"They shared the same identical map.","good":"They shared an identical map."},{"bad":"The trip began on time.","good":"The trip began on time."}]}
