      {"bad":"The family went on holiday. They took a photo of the harbour. The weather was beautiful. They made some photos of the sunset. They framed the best one.","good":"The family went on holiday. They took a photo of the harbour. The weather was beautiful. They took some photos of the sunset. They framed the best one.","explanation":"The collocation is \"take a photo\", not \"make a photo\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The family went on holiday.","good":"The family went on holiday."},{"bad":"They took a photo of the harbour.","good":"They took a photo of the harbour."},{"bad":"The weather was beautiful.","good":"The weather was beautiful."},{"bad":"They made some photos of the sunset.","good":"They took some photos of the sunset."},{"bad":"They framed the best one.","good":"They framed the best one."}]},
      {"bad":"The students revised for the test. They did a lot of progress. Their confidence grew. They took a decision to study together. The whole class passed.","good":"The students revised for the test. They made a lot of progress. Their confidence grew. They made a decision to study together. The whole class passed.","explanation":"We \"make progress\" and \"make a decision\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The students revised for the test.","good":"The students revised for the test."},{"bad":"They did a lot of progress.","good":"They made a lot of progress."},{"bad":"Their confidence grew.","good":"Their confidence grew."},{"bad":"They took a decision to study together.","good":"They made a decision to study together."},{"bad":"The whole class passed.","good":"The whole class passed."}]},
      {"bad":"The neighbours were friendly. They made us a warm welcome. They invited us for dinner. They took a lot of effort with the meal. It was a lovely evening.","good":"The neighbours were friendly. They gave us a warm welcome. They invited us for dinner. They put a lot of effort into the meal. It was a lovely evening.","explanation":"We \"give a welcome\" and \"put effort into\" something.","sentences":[{"bad":"The neighbours were friendly.","good":"The neighbours were friendly."},{"bad":"They made us a warm welcome.","good":"They gave us a warm welcome."},{"bad":"They invited us for dinner.","good":"They invited us for dinner."},{"bad":"They took a lot of effort with the meal.","good":"They put a lot of effort into the meal."},{"bad":"It was a lovely evening.","good":"It was a lovely evening."}]},
