      {"bad":"The council reviewed the proposal. The plan was a bit of a disaster. A new committee was formed. The old system was pretty useless. The new plan was approved.","good":"The council reviewed the proposal. The plan was unsuccessful. A new committee was formed. The old system was ineffective. The new plan was approved.","explanation":"Choose formal wording: \"unsuccessful\", \"ineffective\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The council reviewed the proposal.","good":"The council reviewed the proposal."},{"bad":"The plan was a bit of a disaster.","good":"The plan was unsuccessful."},{"bad":"A new committee was formed.","good":"A new committee was formed."},{"bad":"The old system was pretty useless.","good":"The old system was ineffective."},{"bad":"The new plan was approved.","good":"The new plan was approved."}]},
      {"bad":"The doctor spoke to the patient. The treatment was kinda painful. The patient asked several questions. The recovery was a total breeze. The patient was soon discharged.","good":"The doctor spoke to the patient. The treatment was quite painful. The patient asked several questions. The recovery was straightforward. The patient was soon discharged.","explanation":"Use formal vocabulary: \"quite painful\", \"straightforward\".","sentences":[{"bad":"The doctor spoke to the patient.","good":"The doctor spoke to the patient."},{"bad":"The treatment was kinda painful.","good":"The treatment was quite painful."},{"bad":"The patient asked several questions.","good":"The patient asked several questions."},{"bad":"The recovery was a total breeze.","good":"The recovery was straightforward."},{"bad":"The patient was soon discharged.","good":"The patient was soon discharged."}]}
